def _uv_cut(tail):
    """`tail` up to the first `&&`, `||`, `;`, `|`, `)` or backtick that is outside a quote (R6).

    Quote state starts closed at the `uv`. A backslash escapes the next character outside single
    quotes. An unbalanced quote cuts nothing, so the words run on and an option value no longer
